Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 12:19:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add --time-limit to sandboxed build and run.

A loop back-edge, every 64th function entry, and thread::sleep stop the
program with L0533 when it runs past the deadline. The host wall clock
stays the backstop for a straight-line body.
